OpenCut Classic
===============

This directory vendors source from:

  https://github.com/opencut-app/opencut-classic

License: MIT (see LICENSE)

Used by Jumeng opensource local canvas as the default video editor shell
(`/jumeng/[project_id]` bridge). The upstream project is archived; Jumeng
maintains local patches under `apps/web/src/jumeng/` and related edits.

Windows note: `bun install` may fail under deep paths. Use the short-path
mirror helper scripts in the monorepo root (`npm run editor:install`).
